3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">ひなのちゃんの<ruby>島<rt>しま</rt></ruby>に<ruby>訪問<rt>ほうもん</rt></ruby>させてもらったんですけど、すごくかわいくて<ruby>島<rt>しま</rt></ruby><ruby>作<rt>づく</rt></ruby>りが<ruby>上手<rt>じょうず</rt></ruby>で<ruby>島<rt>しま</rt></ruby>が<ruby>広<rt>ひろ</rt></ruby>く<ruby>感<rt>かん</rt></ruby>じました</span><span class=\"s5\">( ¨̮ )</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>他<rt>た</rt></ruby>のゲームもしよーっていうお<ruby>話<rt>はなし</rt></ruby>もしたのでまたしたいです！！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s6\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>何<rt>なん</rt></ruby><ruby>枚<rt>まい</rt></ruby>か<ruby>載<rt>の</rt></ruby>っけたことない<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby>パーッと<ruby>載<rt>の</rt></ruby>っけまーす！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-06-25/34465_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7487.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>何<rt>なに</rt></ruby>その<ruby>口<rt>くち</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s5\">(</span><span class=\"s9\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Sinhala Sangam MN&quot;;\">ව</span><span class=\"s10\">̐</span><span class=\"s11\">👄</span><span class=\"s9\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Sinhala Sangam MN&quot;;\">ව</span><span class=\"s10\">̐</span><span class=\"s5\">)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-06-25/34465_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7748.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>何<rt>なに</rt></ruby>その<ruby>口<rt>くち</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s11\">😒</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s11\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-06-25/34465_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8172.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">だから<ruby>何<rt>なに</rt></ruby>その<ruby>口<rt>くち</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s3\">😮</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">とゆうより、すごく<ruby>乾燥<rt>かんそう</rt></ruby>してますね</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-06-25/34465_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7692.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">どういう<ruby>感情<rt>かんじょう</rt></ruby>〜</span><span class=\"s3\">😑</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>沢山<rt>たくさん</rt></ruby>ありました<ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby><ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>意外<rt>いがい</rt></ruby>とボツになった<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby>があるもんですね。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s4\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s2\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s4\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">では、<ruby>山口<rt>やまぐち</rt></ruby>クイズです</span><span class=\"s1\">(^</span><span class=\"s2\">ワ</span><span class=\"s1\">^</span><span class=\"s2\">＝</span><span class=\"s1\">)</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\">🐮</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>最近<rt>さいきん</rt></ruby><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>が</span><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>番<rt>ばん</rt></ruby><ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べたいといっているものがありますそれはどーれだ。という<ruby>問題<rt>もんだい</rt></ruby>でした！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\">💁‍♀️</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>正解<rt>せいかい</rt></ruby>は⑶のピーナッツバターパンです！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>家<rt>いえ</rt></ruby>でよく<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べてたので<ruby>懐<rt>なつ</rt></ruby>かしくなり<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べたくなりました</span><span class=\"s3\">🥜</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>最近<rt>さいきん</rt></ruby><ruby>友達<rt>ともだち</rt></ruby>と<ruby>通話<rt>つうわ</rt></ruby>しながら<ruby>食べ物<rt>たべもの</rt></ruby>の<ruby>話題<rt>わだい</rt></ruby>が<ruby>多<rt>おお</rt></ruby>いような<ruby>気<rt>き</rt></ruby>がします</span><span class=\"s3\">🤤</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">あと、ユッケも<ruby>焼き鳥<rt>やきとり</rt></ruby>も<ruby>餃子<rt>ぎょうざ</rt></ruby>も<ruby>家<rt>いえ</rt></ruby>に<ruby>帰<rt>かえ</rt></ruby>ったら<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べよって<ruby>言<rt>い</rt></ruby>う<ruby>約束<rt>やくそく</rt></ruby>を<ruby>家族<rt>かぞく</rt></ruby>としました</span><span class=\"s1\">( ¨̮ )</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">それまで<ruby>我慢<rt>がまん</rt></ruby>ですね</span><span class=\"s3\">😆</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">13</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>回<rt>かい</rt></ruby><ruby>目<rt>め</rt></ruby>の<ruby>山口<rt>やまぐち</rt></ruby>クイズです！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">（ｼﾞｬｰｼﾞｬﾝ</span><span class=\"s3\">🎶</span><span class=\"s2\">）</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\">🐷</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>好<rt>す</rt></ruby>きなラーメンの<ruby>味<rt>あじ</rt></ruby>はなんでしょう。</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">これ、<ruby>選択肢<rt>せんたくし</rt></ruby>いるかな？と<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>ったのでなしにします！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>多分<rt>たぶん</rt></ruby><ruby>当<rt>あ</rt></ruby>たる！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>答<rt>こた</rt></ruby>えは</span><span class=\"s1\">3</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>日<rt>にち</rt></ruby><ruby>後<rt>ご</rt></ruby>です！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s4\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s2\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s4\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-06-25/34465_6.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8204.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>今日<rt>きょう</rt></ruby>は<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby><ruby>多<rt>おお</rt></ruby>めのブログとなってしまいましたね。</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">まあいいですよね。たまには！</span><span class=\"s3\">😃</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>明日<rt>あした</rt></ruby>はみくにちゃんです</span><span class=\"s3\">🌈</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>最後<rt>さいご</rt></ruby>まで<ruby>読<rt>よ</rt></ruby>んで<ruby>下<rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さりありがとうございました。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">では、またね</span><span class=\"s3\">🐷</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>山口<rt>やまぐち</rt></ruby><ruby>陽<rt>よう</rt></ruby><ruby>世<rt>よ</rt></ruby>でした</span><span class=\"s3\">👋🏻</span></p></div>\n                    ",
